  "articleBody": "A kitchen layout redesign should begin with how your household cooks, stores food, gathers, and moves through the room—not with cabinet styles. A qualified design-build provider can compare same-footprint updates with plans that move walls, appliances, plumbing, gas, or electrical systems, then clarify design, permitting, construction, and inspection requirements before work begins.",
